        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_3\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Resolved: </strong>We can confirm that work was carried out and this has now been resolved.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Update: </strong>Technicians are continuing to work through and we expect a resolution early this evening.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Update: </strong>Technicians are still working on a resolution. We&#8217;ll provide further updates as we have them to hand.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Update:</strong> Technicians are currently onsite and are working on the resolution.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Original Update:</strong> We\u2019re aware of an outage impacting the Huntly area.</span></p>\n<p>The cause appears to be fibre-related. We&#8217;re currently investigating and will provide more information when we can.<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/outage-impacting-the-huntly-area/\">Resolved: Outage impacting the Huntly area</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
